<title>UK: NORWICH TO LIST ON IRISH STOCK EXCHANGE.</title>
<headline>NORWICH TO LIST ON IRISH STOCK EXCHANGE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>British insurance group  Norwich Union said on Wednesday it would join the official list of the Irish Stock Exchange on August 14.</p>
<p>The company was floated on the London Stock Exchange in June.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
